<p dir="auto"><h2 tabindex="-1" dir="auto">The tests need SmolLM2-360M and WikiText-2</h2><a id="user-content-the-tests-need-smollm2-360m-and-wikitext-2" aria-label="Permalink: The tests need SmolLM2-360M and WikiText-2" href="#the-tests-need-smollm2-360m-and-wikitext-2"></a></p>
