            <title><![CDATA[ClawDOS – An AI coding agent for DOS (161 pts)]]></title>
            <link>http://ricapar.net/ClawDOS/</link>
            <guid>50586292</guid>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:38:01 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="http://ricapar.net/ClawDOS/">http://ricapar.net/ClawDOS/</a>, See on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50586292">Hacker News</a></p>
<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div>
      <a href="https://github.com/Ricapar/ClawDOS" title="ClawDOS on GitHub">
        
        <span><span>Ricapar/</span>ClawDOS</span>
